mlx-stream is a plugin for mlx-serve (https://github.com/ddalcu/mlx-serve,
Copyright (c) 2026 David Dalcu, MIT). It was split out of a fork of mlx-serve;
the files it shares with the host's SDK seams (src/sdk_ext/check.zig, the
no-cache read helpers in src/nocache_io.zig and the n-gram table in
src/ngram_table.zig) were written for that fork by this repository's author,
and so was sdk/ (the arch contract, the weight loader and the reads past the
page cache), mlx-serve's plugin SDK in that fork, now kept here.

The DeepSeek-V4.1 streaming runtime this plugin was ported from (the packed
expert record and manifest formats, the streamed-bank layout read by
src/expert_bank.zig and the routed-expert EXL3 Metal kernels pinned under
src/kernels/exl3/) is this repository's author's own earlier work, written in
Python; it is the plugin's parity oracle. It is Copyright (c) 2026 David Tai
and is distributed here under the MIT License.

