DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash
The DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash release's `inference/model.py` is the reference for the
`deepseek_v41` architecture. No model weights are included in this repository.

The independent consumer fixtures src/fixtures/dsv41_official_{engram,dequant}.json
and scripts/dump_dsv41_reference_fixtures.py use the official Engram CPU forward
and stored FP8/FP4 decoding specification at revision
2cba9e42aa026125f3ed06c6d98c1db82f7ca027:
